{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MAW is a detective RPG about a queer officer who is struggling with his identity in a repressive society.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_state.png?t=1744883332\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_03.gif?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the state. Investigate crimes. Keep your identity hidden.  Become an animal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_sniff.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_01.gif?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your animal instincts to find clues. Sniff, lick, listen to get information. Talk with other animals. Observe them. Interrogate them. Date them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_romance.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_02.gif?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At day, you solve crimes. At night, you date at the club. There would be consequences if the state would find out... or worse, if your mother would.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_story.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of MAW is loosely based on personal experiences. Characters and events are fictional. Emotions and everyday struggles depicted in this game are real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_characters.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic narrative - Characters react to your decisions, stats, appearance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animal instincts - Use animal abilities (sniffing, licking, etc.) to find clues, explore the environment and interact with other characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable appearance - Wear different outfits and see how the world reacts to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to date and build relationship with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectible cards with unique furry art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal queer story based on real world experiences</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273860?t=1744883332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273860?t=1744883332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/db9e81cfa9f91bbb8ac5dfef8a634f9662e6b330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744883332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/db9e81cfa9f91bbb8ac5dfef8a634f9662e6b330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744883332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"MAW deals with adult queer themes. Some dialogues contain references to sexual acts. Optional collectible magazines feature some drawings of adult characters in suggestive posses. Violence is always only suggested and/or pixelated (censored)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MAW is a detective RPG about a queer officer who is struggling with his identity in a repressive society.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_state.png?t=1744883332\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_03.gif?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the state. Investigate crimes. Keep your identity hidden.  Become an animal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_sniff.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_01.gif?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your animal instincts to find clues. Sniff, lick, listen to get information. Talk with other animals. Observe them. Interrogate them. Date them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_romance.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/clip_02.gif?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At day, you solve crimes. At night, you date at the club. There would be consequences if the state would find out... or worse, if your mother would.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_story.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of MAW is loosely based on personal experiences. Characters and events are fictional. Emotions and everyday struggles depicted in this game are real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/extras/store_graphics_characters.png?t=1744883332\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic narrative - Characters react to your decisions, stats, appearance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animal instincts - Use animal abilities (sniffing, licking, etc.) to find clues, explore the environment and interact with other characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable appearance - Wear different outfits and see how the world reacts to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple characters to date and build relationship with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectible cards with unique furry art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal queer story based on real world experiences</p></li></ul>","developers":["Zakroutil"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273860/header.jpg?t=1744883332","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121665,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie480.mp4?t=1744883330","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie_max.mp4?t=1744883330"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121665/48025ea427fed669a1ec4e4cb0b281d352f1b70d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744883330","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744883330","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121665/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744883330"}}],"name":"MAW","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor: